data: {"id": "694366e01a7e4222-thinking-layer-762", "run_id": "694366e01a7e4222", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据对集群中 66 个 Pod 的扫描，发现 1 个异常 Pod。\n\n### 异常定位结果\n\n*   **异常 Pod**: `workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` (Namespace: `aiops-case-03`)\n*   **当前状态**: `ContainerCreating`\n*   **异常类型**: 镜像拉取异常或启动配置异常 (`ImagePullFailed` 兼容类型)\n*   **分组**: 1 个异常组 (基于 `ImagePullFailed` 异常类型)\n\n**分析说明**:\n该 Pod 长时间处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，且未分配到 IP。根据常见场景，这通常是由镜像拉取失败（如认证、网络、镜像不存在）或卷挂载问题引起的。为了进行更深入的诊断，已调取 `pod-imagepull-failed.md` 诊断手册。建议下一步执行 `kubectl describe pod <pod-name>` 查看具体 Events（如 `Failed to pull image` 或 `Back-off` 等错误）以确定确切根因", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789051227355}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "694366e01a7e4222-node_complete-layer", "run_id": "694366e01a7e4222", "seq": 763, "ts_ms": 1789051236373, "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "duration_seconds": 22.363, "state_snapshot": {"layer": "Layer.ABNORMAL", "layers": ["ABNORMAL"], "layer_confidence": 0.5, "layer_reasoning": "扫描集群发现 1 个非 Running/Completed 状态的 Pod。该 Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态且未分配 IP，根据异常类型分类及 Runbook 指引，高度疑似镜像拉取失败（ImagePullFailed）。需结合 Events 进一步区分具体错误（如认证、网络或镜像不存在）。", "layer_analysis": "{\"layer\": \"DIAGNOSIS\", \"derived_layer\": \"\", \"layers\": [], \"layer_name\": \"\", \"confidence\": 0.5, \"reasoning\": \"扫描集群发现 1 个非 Running/Completed 状态的 Pod。该 Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态且未分配 IP，根据异常类型分类及 Runbook 指引，高度疑似镜像拉取失败（ImagePullFailed）。需结合 Events 进一步区分具体错误（如认证、网络或镜像不存在）。\", \"abnormal_pods\": [{\"name\": \"workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-03\", \"status\": \"ContainerCreating\"}], \"pod_status_keyword\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ImagePullFailed\", \"status_category\": \"Abnormal\", \"key_entities\": [{\"type\": \"Pod\", \"name\": \"workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-03\"}], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"镜像仓库认证失败\", \"probability\": \"High\", \"reason\": \"ContainerCreating 状态常见于 ImagePullBackOff/ErrImagePull，unauthorized 是常见根因之一。\"}, {\"scenario\": \"镜像名称或 Tag 错误\", \"probability\": \"High\", \"reason\": \"manifest unknown/not found 会导致拉取失败，Pod 停留在创建阶段。\"}, {\"scenario\": \"节点到镜像仓库网络不可达\", \"probability\": \"Medium\", \"reason\": \"DNS 解析失败、防火墙拦截或连接超时会导致拉取失败。\"}, {\"scenario\": \"卷挂载或节点资源问题\", \"probability\": \"Low\", \"reason\": \"虽然较少见，但 PersistentVolume 挂载失败或节点资源不足也可能导致 ContainerCreating 挂起。\"}], \"abnormal_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"ContainerCreating\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-03\", \"name\": \"workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"pos