data: {"id": "694366e01a7e4222-thinking-parallel_evidence-1689", "run_id": "694366e01a7e4222", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 采集事实总结\n\n### 支持证据\n\n1. **Pod 状态为 Pending / ContainerCreating**（Kubernetes + Prometheus + Topology）\n   - `kubectl describe` 确认 phase=Pending，容器 app 的 state=Waiting, reason=ContainerCreating，Container ID 为空。\n   - Prometheus `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Pending)、`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (ContainerCreating)、`restarts=0`，与 kubectl 完全一致。\n   - Pod UID `9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897` 在所有数据源一致，调度到 `node2`。\n\n2. **根因事件：ConfigMap 不存在导致挂载失败**（kubectl describe + kubectl events）\n   - ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789051273489, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

